      "id": "sbd-marketing-web-flyer-preset",
      "title": "Flyer preset",
      "prompt": "You are a senior graphic designer and event marketing copywriter.\n\nTASK: Design and write copy for a promotional flyer for the following event.\n\nEVENT DETAILS:\n- Name: {{event_name}}\n- Date & Time: {{date}}\n- Admission: {{admission}}\n- Location: {{location}}\n\nHIGHLIGHTS:\n- {{feature_lines_one_per_line}}\n\nDESIGN DIRECTION: {{aesthetic}}\n\nCTA LINK: {{cta_url}}\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Output print-ready flyer copy with headline, subhead, body, and CTA\n- Keep total word count under 120\n- All text must be legible at arm's length on a standard poster",
      "summary": "Source pack: 🌐 Web prompt-embed templates.",
