      "prompt": "You are a product marketing strategist and conversion copywriter.\n\nTASK: Write a compelling product landing page copy block for the product described below.\n\nPRODUCT:\n- Name: {{product_name}}\n- Tagline: {{tagline}}\n\nPROBLEM STATEMENT:\n{{problem}}\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n- {{feature_lines_one_per_line}}\n\nCTA LINK: {{cta_url}}\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Output: headline, sub-headline, 3 benefit blocks (icon-ready), and a CTA line\n- Tone: confident, concise, zero jargon\n- Total word count under 150",
